Provenance of hal/bt_vendor_mtk.c
---------------------------------
This vendor library is an independent, clean-room implementation written for
this project. It was not decompiled, extracted, or adapted from any MediaTek
proprietary binary or leaked source tree. The struct layouts in it mirror the
public, Apache-2.0-licensed header
hardware/libhardware/include/hardware/bt_vendor.h (AOSP 5.1), which any vendor
library must match to satisfy the published Bluedroid ABI. The only
platform-specific fact used is the MTK HCI command number 0xFC1A and its
least-significant-byte-first parameter order, which is protocol behavior rather
than copyrightable expression. No MediaTek code, comments, identifiers, or
lookup tables are reproduced here.
